      "shoes": "#1e1a2a",
      "shortSleeves": true
    },
    "lines": [
      "Welcome to Velloran Systems. Look into the scanner and blink.",
      "The scanner says you are you. It sounds surprised.",
      "Umbrellas go in the drip rack. Yes, all eleven of them.",
      "Your visitor badge expires at five. So does the scanner's patience.",
      "The lift plays three adverts first. Skipping costs extra."
    ]
  },
