        "shoes": "#1c1826",
        "glasses": "#3ff0ff",
        "facialHair": "#1a1420"
      },
      "lines": [
        "I have your browsing history. Do not worry, it is very boring.",
        "Data is the new oil. Mine is mostly the new spreadsheet.",
        "Your lunch order is my bestseller. Everyone wants dumpling data."
      ]
    },
