        "collar": "#ffffff",
        "pants": "#2e5a7a",
        "shoes": "#1c2230",
        "glasses": "#1c1630"
      },
      "lines": [
        "Tomorrow: rain. The day after: rain, but with ambition.",
        "I have been right every day for six years. Nobody throws a party.",
        "There is a three per cent chance of sun. I have alerted the board."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Hex Kowalski",
      "role": "Vending Machine Relations Officer",
      "look": {
        "head": "prankster",
        "skin": "rosy",
        "build": "tall",
        "outfit": "floral",
        "hair": "#1e1a2c",
        "hairHighlight": "#3ff0ff",
        "eye": "#5a3a8a",
        "shirt": "#2a2350",
        "accent": "#3ff0ff",
        "accent2": "#ff4fd8",
        "pants": "#7a6fb0",
        "shoes": "#e8e4f4",
        "shortSleeves": true
      },
      "lines": [
        "The vending machine is in a mood. Praise its lights before you buy.",
        "It gave me two crisps for one. I think we are friends now.",
        "Never say 'just a snack' near it. It takes that very personally."
      ]
    },
    {
